# Pin Quarto's Python to this project's uv-managed venv.
#
# Without this, Quarto auto-discovers whatever python is first on PATH — here
# C:\Envs\gvenv — and starts its "Global Env" (gvenv) kernel. That kernel can
# still `import coursekit` (execute-dir: project puts the repo root on sys.path)
# but has none of the course deps, so decks die on `ModuleNotFoundError:
# No module named 'pyreadr'`.
QUARTO_PYTHON=.venv/Scripts/python.exe
